  "$comment": "Single source of the Civic Paper contrast rule (GDD chapter 07 §7.5). Colours live in mockups.css; this file holds the pairs, their thresholds and what each pair is for. Read by GDD/mockups/assets/contrast_check.py (designer loop) and Genelife.Domain.Tests/Docs/ContrastTokenTests.cs (CI gate). Thresholds restate §7.5.2: body text >= 7:1, everything else >= 4.5:1. Add a pair here, and both readers check it — there is no second copy.",
